# Windsurf Rules - FatturaFacile Integrations Monorepo

Follow the instructions in:
- `AGENTS.md`
- `.ai/rules/project.md`
- `.github/copilot-instructions.md`

## Key Invariants
- Repository: `FatturaFacile/integrations` (MIT License)
- Package Manager: `pnpm` exclusively. Never run `npm` or `yarn`.
- Build System: Turborepo (`turbo run build`, `turbo run test`, `turbo run lint`).
- OpenAPI Single Source of Truth: All ERP communication MUST use `@fatturafacile/openapi-sdk` via `createErpClient()` in `@fatturafacile/shared`. Manual ERP DTOs and raw HTTP requests are strictly forbidden.
- Connectors: Must extend `packages/framework` and use `packages/shared`.
- Every integration package must include a root `manifest.json`.
- Tier Progression: Focus on Tier 1 (WooCommerce, Shopify, WordPress, Microsoft 365, Teams, Stripe, PayPal, Copilot, Claude, Cursor).
- Strict TypeScript: Zero lint or type errors allowed.
